cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived outputs, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Mapping the Intellectual Structure of High-Performance Sport Ecosystem Research"
abstract: >-
  Replication repository for a null-calibrated co-word and thematic-evolution analysis of
  high-performance sport research (2013-2025), examining the governance, innovation and
  talent-development pillars. Includes SEMCON, a validated semantic concept-family
  consolidation procedure, and degree-preserving null models for network structure.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mahsatorabi/high-performance-sport-concept-network"

# Bibliographic records retrieved from Scopus are NOT redistributed (see README).
# Derived outputs (tables, figures, verification files): CC BY 4.0

keywords:
  - bibliometrics
  - science mapping
  - co-word analysis
  - null models
  - concept networks
  - high-performance sport
  - text mining

